/*
 * mfile3 - the header of codgen / scodgen, pass 3 of the WEGA C compiler (as mfile2 of pass 2 of System III; the name
 * after the files ...3.c, the original name is not known):
 * the constants and layouts read from the original binary (names after its strings: SAREG, TBYTE, RLEFT ...), the
 * structures the modules share, and the declarations they share (functions that return int are not declared, as in System III).
 * See host/KNOWLEDGE.md, "codgen / scodgen".
 */
